[size=6][b]Shared Actions[/b][/size]

Use potions, scrolls and throwable items carried by anyone in your party, straight from your Action Bar. The mod adds three buttons, [b]Take Potion[/b], [b]Use Scroll[/b] and [b]Throw[/b], so you don't have to pass items between characters in the middle of a fight.

[line]
[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][url=https://github.com/Norbyte/bg3se]BG3 Script Extender[/url]
[/list]

[line]
[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*][b]Back up your save.[/b] The mod adds spells that are saved with your game.
[*]Download the mod from the [b]Files[/b] tab or from [url=https://github.com/belakarkache/bg3-shared-actions/releases]GitHub Releases[/url].
[*]In [b]BG3 Mod Manager[/b], import the [font=Courier New].zip[/font], enable [b]Shared Actions[/b] and click [b]Export Load Order to Game[/b].
[*]Start the game. The new buttons are on the Action Bar.
[/list]

[line]
[size=4][b]Known issues[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Items from other mods only show up if they were included when this version was built.
[*]Scrolls that cast a spell from another mod are not supported.
[/list]

